      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_56c051eb",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: make america great again!!!; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image features Donald Trump pointing emphatically while overlaid with the text 'make america great again!!!', which is a well-known political slogan associated with his 2016 presidential campaign. The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to evoke strong emotional responses and reinforce support for his political agenda or persona. The visual of Trump in a commanding pose, combined with the slogan, is designed to associate him with leadership, strength, and national rejuvenation. There is no evidence of toxicity such as abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or other forms of targeted discrimination in this specific image. The meme's intent is to promote or reinforce a political message rather than to attack or demean any group or individual.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_592e1d54"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
