      "instance_name": "make_america_great_again_slogan",
      "label": "Make America Great Again Slogan",
      "description": "A political slogan coined by Donald Trump for his 2016 presidential campaign, which became a central rallying cry for his supporters. The slogan is associated with themes of national renewal, economic nationalism, and a return to perceived traditional American values. Its use in memes like this one is intended to evoke strong emotional and political identification.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
