      "instance_name": "american_presidential_campaign",
      "label": "American Presidential Campaign",
      "description": "The process by which candidates run for the office of President of the United States, involving political messaging, rallies, media appearances, and voter mobilization. The meme relies on the understanding that this image is part of a larger political campaign context, which is a fundamental aspect of American democracy and political culture.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
