      "label": "Donald_Trump_2016_Campaign_Supporters",
      "description": "The target community is supporters of Donald Trump's 2016 presidential campaign, who identify with the 'Make America Great Again' slogan and the visual rhetoric associated with Trump's leadership persona. The meme is designed to resonate with this demographic by reinforcing their political identity through the iconic image and slogan, which are central to the campaign's messaging.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
